      "canonical_url": "https://gitstart.com/blog/code-to-inspire",
      "title": "Growing Afghan women with Code To Inspire",
      "summary": "Can you imagine having your entire future disappear right in front of your eyes? That's exactly what happened to 20 million women when the Taliban took over Afghanistan about a year ago. I couldn't just sit back and do nothing, so I started an investigation. What I learned proved horrifying.",
